 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Welcome, Wordsmith!"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "This is a **check-in**, not a test.\n\nGood writers are curious about words and not afraid to guess.\n\nShow us what you know and where you want to learn more."
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "emoji": "✍️",
   "alt": "Time to play with words!",
   "caption": "Time to play with words!"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Stop 1: The jobs words do"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "Every word has a job. A **noun** names a person, place or thing. A **verb** is an action. An **adjective** describes a noun. An **adverb** tells us how, when or where something happens."
  },
  {
   "type": "explainer",
   "title": "The jobs in a sentence",
   "scenes": [
    {
     "caption": "The librarian smiled. Librarian is a noun.",
     "items": [
      {
       "id": "a",
       "emoji": "🧑‍🏫",
       "x": 30,
       "y": 55,
       "size": 3,
       "anim": "none",
       "label": "noun"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "caption": "Smiled is a verb. It is the action.",
     "items": [
      {
       "id": "a",
       "emoji": "🧑‍🏫",
       "x": 30,
       "y": 55,
       "size": 3,
       "anim": "none"
      },
      {
       "id": "b",
       "emoji": "😊",
       "x": 70,
       "y": 55,
       "size": 3,
       "anim": "bounce",
       "label": "verb"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "caption": "Kind is an adjective. It describes the librarian.",
     "items": [
      {
       "id": "a",
       "emoji": "🧑‍🏫",
       "x": 30,
       "y": 55,
       "size": 3,
       "anim": "pulse",
       "label": "kind"
      },
      {
       "id": "b",
       "emoji": "😊",
       "x": 70,
       "y": 55,
       "size": 3,
       "anim": "none"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "caption": "Warmly is an adverb. It tells us how she smiled.",
     "items": [
      {
       "id": "a",
       "emoji": "🧑‍🏫",
       "x": 30,
       "y": 55,
       "size": 3,
       "anim": "none"
      },
      {
       "id": "b",
       "emoji": "😊",
       "x": 70,
       "y": 55,
       "size": 3,
       "anim": "pulse",
       "label": "warmly"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "check",
