  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Stop 3: Tenses"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "**Tense** tells us when something happens. Past: I walked. Present: I walk. Future: I will walk.\n\nSome verbs change in tricky ways, like go becomes went."
  },
